## Consumer Wireless

AT&T's primary consumer wireless line. Use this section for any query related to phone plans, device shopping, switching from another carrier, BYOD, upgrades, prepaid, coverage, international use, security, or wireless discounts.

- [Wireless Hub](https://www.att.com/wireless/): Primary entry point for all consumer wireless. Covers phones, plans, switching, BYOD, upgrades, and accessories.
- [Switch to AT&T](https://www.att.com/wireless/switch-and-save/): Switching offers, Break-Your-Contract details, and switcher savings. Start here for any switching intent.
- [Cell Phone Plans](https://www.att.com/plans/unlimited-data-plans/): Unlimited plan comparison (Extra 2.0, Premium 2.0, Elite 2.0, 55+, 4GB). Includes pricing, features, and multi-line discounts.
- [Shop Phones & Devices](https://www.att.com/buy/phones/): Full device catalog with current promotional pricing, trade-in offers, and installment options.
- [Compare Phones](https://www.att.com/device-compare/apple-iphone-17/): Side-by-side device comparison tool. Compare specs, pricing, and features across multiple AT&T phones before purchasing.
- [Certified Pre-Owned Phones](https://www.att.com/buy/phones/browse/att-certified-preowned): Refurbished and pre-owned smartphones available at reduced prices. Includes device condition ratings and warranty details.
- [BYOD - Bring Your Own Device](https://www.att.com/wireless/byod/): Check if your phone is compatible with AT&T's network. Includes IMEI checker and activation flow.
- [Transfer Your Number](https://www.att.com/wireless/transfer-your-number/): Port eligibility checker, carrier-by-carrier and Transfer PIN instructions.
- [Trade-In Program](https://tradein.att.com/): Estimate trade-in value for your current device. Returns credit amount and tier.
- [Wireless Deals & Offers](https://www.att.com/deals/): Current promotions across devices, plans, and switching offers. Updated frequently.
- [Upgrade Your Phone](https://www.att.com/plans/phone-upgrade/): Early upgrade options and installment plan terms.
- [AT&T Next Up Anytime](https://www.att.com/plans/next-up-anytime/): Early upgrade program - upgrade to a new device at any time with no trade-in required. Available as an add-on to installment plans.
- [AT&T Turbo](https://www.att.com/plans/att-turbo/): Premium data performance add-on for wireless plans. Provides enhanced speeds and priority data during network congestion.
- [Add a Line](https://www.att.com/plans/add-a-line/): Add a new line to an existing AT&T wireless account.
- [Prepaid Plans](https://www.att.com/prepaid/): No-contract prepaid phone plans, BYOD prepaid, and prepaid device options.
- [Prepaid Phones](https://www.att.com/buy/prepaid-phones/): Prepaid device catalog. Phones available with no annual contract or credit check required.
- [Wireless Coverage Map](https://www.att.com/maps/wireless-coverage.html): Check 5G, 5G+, and LTE coverage by address or ZIP code.
- [Free 30-Day Trial](https://www.att.com/wireless/free-trial/): eSIM-based trial available on iPhone only. Keep your current number and carrier active while testing AT&T's network free for 30 days.
- [International Plans](https://www.att.com/international/): International calling, texting, and data plan options for travel.
- [AT&T ActiveArmor Security](https://www.att.com/security/active-armor/): Mobile security app - spam blocking, fraud alerts, network protection. Free with compatible plans.
- [Discount Programs](https://www.att.com/verification/signaturehub/#employment): Occupational and affiliation discounts (military, first responders, teachers, nurses, seniors, students, employees).
- [Wireless Accessories](https://www.att.com/buy/accessories/): Cases, chargers, headphones, and device protection. Compatible with AT&T devices and BYOD.
- [Device Protection](https://www.att.com/offers/device-protection/): AT&T device protection plans - mobile insurance, ProTech support, and screen repair options for wireless devices.
- [Tablets & Connected Devices](https://www.att.com/buy/tablets/): Shop iPads, Galaxy Tabs, and other connected tablets on AT&T plans.
- [Smartwatches & Wearables](https://www.att.com/buy/wearables/): Shop smartwatches and connected wearables for AT&T wireless service.
- [AT&T Guarantee](https://www.att.com/why-att/guarantee/): AT&T's service commitment - includes network reliability, bill transparency, and satisfaction guarantees across wireless and internet.
- [NumberSync](https://www.att.com/features/numbersync/): Use your AT&T phone number across multiple devices - smartwatches, tablets, and more. Calls and texts share one number without forwarding.
- [Wi-Fi Calling](https://www.att.com/features/wifi-calling/): Make and receive calls and texts over a Wi-Fi connection when cellular signal is weak or unavailable. Available on compatible AT&T devices.

